<TXSPN>"<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>, are you there?"<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
"Hey, you're in there, aren't you? I saw you go up the stairs a minute ago."<PG>
"I'm coming in, okay?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
