{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜寝るバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "2" "2000" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>, aren't you going to eat? It's the New Year's feast, you know?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"My, your face is cold. Here, put on another layer."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE>Auntie<STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hm?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Why don't the people in this settlement run away?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Run away...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Erica.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"They might die next April... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Why don't they run away?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Everyone feels scared, you know. But they're trying to stand up to it without being afraid. 
{PAUSE ""}
As long as <STYLE ID="2">Grandma</STYLE> feels that way, no one will run away."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then did </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> run away?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="3">Chigaya-chan</STYLE>...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Didn't </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> run away to Tokyo because she was scared of the curse-killings?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's not true. <STYLE ID="3">Chigaya-chan</STYLE> went away to study so she can make this settlement better."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I heard, you know. </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> might go study abroad."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Study abroad? That's the first I've heard of it..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Studying abroad means going to another country and not coming back for even longer, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Isn't it so she can run away from this settlement?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What did you and <STYLE ID="3">Chigaya-chan</STYLE> talk about?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... said </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s the culprit..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What do you think, </STYLE>Auntie<STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hmm, let me see... I don't know. 
{PAUSE ""}
But this must be hard on <STYLE ID="3">Chigaya-chan</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hard...?"</STYLE><PG>
"I think it's very hard to believe <STYLE ID="4">your own father</STYLE> is the culprit. 
{PAUSE ""}
I'm sure she didn't want to admit it either, just like <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>, and I think telling <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> about it took a lot of courage, too."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"But... </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> being the culprit... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I really can't forgive </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ナイフを構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\ナイフ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"What are you going to do?!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s gone, so I don't want </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> getting caught and going away too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Isn't <STYLE ID="3">Chigaya-chan</STYLE> your family?!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Anyone who says </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s the culprit isn't family!"</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>, I understand how you feel, but you mustn't say things like that. 
{PAUSE ""}
Is that knife for cutting your family?
{PAUSE ""}
　Put it away."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Once I find out who the culprit is, I'll kill them with this knife."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Put the knife away."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'll protect </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...!"</STYLE><PG>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="6">"I told you to put it away!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜寝るバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Uuu... </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> being the culprit...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　No...! Nooo...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>, listen carefully. 
{PAUSE ""}
I'm sure <STYLE ID="3">Chigaya-chan</STYLE> hasn't told anyone yet that <STYLE ID="4">your father</STYLE> is the culprit. She told <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> first. 
{PAUSE ""}
Do you know why?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"............? Sniff."</STYLE><PG>
"If she really thought he was the culprit, she'd tell a grown-up first, wouldn't she? 
{PAUSE ""}
But if she told only <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>, then: <STYLE ID="3">'The way things are now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s going to be made the culprit. So let's prove he's innocent together.' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Wasn't that what she wanted to say?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... said everyone's fallen into paranoia."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's right. At a time like that, if <STYLE ID="3">Chigaya-chan</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="けんか">fought</STYLE>, it would be even worse, wouldn't it?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hm?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜寝るバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s definitely mad at me..."</STYLE><PG>
"It's all right. <STYLE ID="3">Chigaya-chan</STYLE> knows it's only natural that <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> got angry. 
{PAUSE ""}
So let's go downstairs together, okay?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"But... I still can never forgive the culprit. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Because the culprit killed </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That may be so. But there's something you need to do before you hate the culprit, isn't there?
{PAUSE ""}
　Making up with your precious family."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay... I'll make up with </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. Because I do love </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> after all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm-hm, that's my good girl. Now, let's go together."<PG>
