{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Snorrrk! Snorrrk! Mnyaa..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"C'mon, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you too! Drink, drink, drink!"</STYLE>
