{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Honestly... who does she take after... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Come to think of it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was a pretty bad drunk too."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Ahahahaha! See, I'm not like </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, I'm a total knockout who takes after </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, looks and all, right?!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Of course I'm like her!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"That's it, that's it! At New Year's there's </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="にゃ">nuffin'</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> to do but drink! Havin' a beauty like </STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="きょ">dish</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> pour for me... I'm </STYLE><STYLE ID="14" RUBY="りゃ">sho</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> glad I'm al</STYLE><STYLE ID="15" RUBY="は">iii</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">ve!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10" RUBY="しろざき">Shirozaki</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, that's sexual harassment! The late </STYLE><STYLE ID="16" RUBY="ゆりこ">Yuriko</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">-san's gonna be mad at you!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　For a </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">lecherous old geezer</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> like you, the total knockout Chigaya-sama will keep pouring till you drop dead!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Oh-ho! This is paradise! Paradise!"</STYLE><PG>
